{"ref":"BDB, שְׂחֹק","hw":"שְׂחֹק","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">שְׂחֹק</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׂחוֹק</span></big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>laughter, derision, sport (</strong>proposes inf. cstr.<strong>)</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׂחֹק</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 48:26\" href=\"/Jeremiah.48.26\">Je 48:26</a> + 5 times; cstr. <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 7:6\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.7.6\">Ec 7:6</a>; abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׂחוֹק</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 20:7\" href=\"/Jeremiah.20.7\">Je 20:7</a> + 7 times;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>laughter</em> (joyous) <a data-ref=\"Job 8:21\" href=\"/Job.8.21\">Jb 8:21</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּרוּעָה</span>), <a data-ref=\"Psalms 126:2\" href=\"/Psalms.126.2\">ψ 126:2</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">רִנָּה</span>), <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 2:2\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.2.2\">Ec 2:2</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">שִׂמְחָה</span>), <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 10:19\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.10.19\">10:19</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">שִׂמֵּחַ</span>); as hollow <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 14:13\" href=\"/Proverbs.14.13\">Pr 14:13</a> (opp. <span dir=\"rtl\">כָּאַב</span>), <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 7:3\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.7.3\">Ec 7:3</a> (opp. <span dir=\"rtl\">כַּעַס</span>), cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">שׂ׳ הַכְּסִיל</span> v <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 7:6\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.7.6\">6</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  (object of) <em>derision</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">הָיָה לִשׂ׳</span>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 20:7\" href=\"/Jeremiah.20.7\">Je 20:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 48:26\" href=\"/Jeremiah.48.26\">48:26</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 48:27\" href=\"/Jeremiah.48.27\">27</a> (read <span dir=\"rtl\">לִשׂ׳</span> for MT <span dir=\"rtl\">הַשּׂ׳</span> 𝔊 𝔖 𝔙 Gie Du; Co del. vv), v <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 48:39\" href=\"/Jeremiah.48.39\">39</a> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 3:14\" href=\"/Lamentations.3.14\">La 3:14</a>; elsewhere <a data-ref=\"Job 12:4\" href=\"/Job.12.4\">Jb 12:4</a><sup>(×2)</sup>.<br><strong>3.<